From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ai_re <ai_re@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:00:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 35/35] board: dmc12: pin the boot flash SSI as spi0

With DESIGNWARE_SPI: aliases/spi0 = the SSI at 0xfd882000, so its seq is
0 whatever the probe order ("sf probe 0:x", ENV_SPI_BUS and the write
window's bus number rely on it).

Scope: dmc12.
---
 arch/arm/dts/alpine-v2-dmc12-u-boot.dtsi | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/alpine-v2-dmc12-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/alpine-v2-dmc12-u-boot.dtsi
index 2b3f4c59..bef50091 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/alpine-v2-dmc12-u-boot.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/alpine-v2-dmc12-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -119,6 +119,13 @@
 &spi0 {
 	spi-max-frequency = <25000000>;
 };
+
+/* seq 0 is the boot flash SSI: "sf probe 0:x", ENV_SPI_BUS and the write window rely on it */
+/ {
+	aliases {
+		spi0 = &spi0;
+	};
+};
 #endif
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_ALPINE_V2_GPIO_INIT
